t, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 108.4% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $488.0m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2032966/000162828026030885/0001628280-26-030885-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030885"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 18.6% to 33.1% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2032966/000162828026030885/0001628280-26-030885-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030885"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $45.3m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2032966/000162828026030885/0001628280-26-030885-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030885"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 57.8% across 3 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2032966/000162828026030885/0001628280-26-030885-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030885"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-6.0% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2032966/000162828026030885/0001628280-26-030885-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030885"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $19.6m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2032966/000162828026030885/0001628280-26-030885-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030885"},{"text":"Only 6 quarters of reported history. There is no track record here to speak of, and a short series flatters whatever the recent trend happens to be.","source_url":"https://ww